#ASSERT `s 47(1)(e): the most, in penalty units, the daily fine for a continuing offence under the regulations may be` TRUE (JUST 8) EQUALS JUST 8
#ASSERT `s 47(1)(e): the most, in penalty units, the daily fine for a continuing offence under the regulations may be` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS JUST 5
