#ASSERT `s 47(10): it is not necessary to prove compliance with the filing and recording in proceedings under or in relation to the regulation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 47(11): the regulation is to be filed and recorded by the Chief Parliamentary Counsel in the responsible Department in relation to the Legislation Publication Act 1996` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 47(11): the regulation is to be filed and recorded by the Chief Parliamentary Counsel in the responsible Department in relation to the Legislation Publication Act 1996` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 47(12): the regulation may not be challenged on the ground of non-observance of subsection (11)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 47(12): the regulation may not be challenged on the ground of non-observance of subsection (11)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 47(12): it is not necessary to prove compliance with subsection (11) in proceedings under or in relation to the regulation` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
